      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2023-01-17T23:58:48.814Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Glad I’m not the only GM who has trouble coming up with environment-related things, on the fly or otherwise. I need to ask my players for twist ideas more often, but I guarantee I’ll get a lot of “the villain just blows up”.</p>\n<p>I hope this becomes Adhesivist commits tax evasion. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"></p>\n<p>So what I’m hearing is a good setup for a set of Mega Man X bosses.</p>",
