    {
      "id": 250384,
      "name": "MindWanderer",
      "username": "MindWanderer",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
      "created_at": "2023-01-18T20:56:21.348Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I struggle with environments, too.  Not every fight has to be in some interesting setpiece location, but having no environment shouldn’t be the default.  It’s hard to not to have a ton of scenes in cities with collapsing power lines, sewers, and bystanders getting in the way all the time.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Godai\" data-post=\"5\" data-topic=\"29830\" data-full=\"true\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/godai/48/1920_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Godai:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Any bets on the mystery boss(es)? They definitely made it sound like the three you have to fight are already themed to their unique drivers.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>The Order of the Simple Machine leaps immediately to mind.  They’re a Paradigms villain, they’re in Rook City, and there are 3 main lieutenants.  The Organization is also possible.</p>",
      "post_number": 7,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2023-01-18T20:56:21.348Z",
      "reply_count": 1,
      "reply_to_post_number": 5,
